<a href="https://www.github.com/google-deepmind/alphaproof-nexus-results" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://www.github.com/google-deepmind/alphaproof-nexus-results</a>. Natural language proofs
of some key results are provided in the repository and the supplementary text.</p>
